{# A contract in the template subset of ADR 0042. #}
<style>
h1 { font-family: interdisplay; font-size: 24pt; font-weight: normal; }
h2 { font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; }
p { font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 1.45; }
table.clauses td { font-size: 9.5pt; line-height: 1.45; vertical-align: top; }
table.parties td { font-size: 9pt; vertical-align: top; }
.label { color: #6b6b6b; }
.muted { color: #6b6b6b; }
.line { border-top: 0.3mm solid #222222; }
</style>
<h1>Non-disclosure agreement</h1>
<p>This non-disclosure agreement (the “Agreement”) is made on the day stated below between:</p>
<table class="parties" cellpadding="1.5" width="100%">
<tr>
<td width="48%"><table cellpadding="1">
<tr><td colspan="2" class="muted">Party 1</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="2" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;">{{ firm.name }}</td></tr>
<tr><td class="label" width="25mm">Address</td><td>{{ firm.address_lines|join(", ") }}</td></tr>
<tr><td class="label" width="25mm">Reg. no.</td><td>{{ firm.registration_number }}</td></tr>
<tr><td class="label" width="25mm">VAT id</td><td>{{ firm.vat_id|default("–") }}</td></tr>
</table></td>
<td width="4%"></td>
<td width="48%"><table cellpadding="1">
<tr><td colspan="2" class="muted">Party 2</td></tr>
<tr><td colspan="2" style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 11pt;">{{ client.name }}</td></tr>
<tr><td class="label" width="25mm">Address</td><td>{{ client.address_lines|join(", ") }}</td></tr>
<tr><td class="label" width="25mm">Reg. no.</td><td>{{ client.registration_number }}</td></tr>
{% for person in client.persons %}<tr><td class="label" width="25mm">Contact</td><td>{{ person.name }}{% if person.email %}, {{ person.email }}{% endif %}</td></tr>{% endfor %}
</table></td>
</tr>
</table>
<div style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
<h2>1&nbsp;&nbsp;Confidentiality</h2>
<table class="clauses" cellpadding="1">
<tr><td width="10mm">1.1</td><td width="160mm">Party 1 shall not disclose to any third party, nor use for any purpose other than the cooperation with Party 2, any information of a business nature that it learns in connection with that cooperation. In particular it shall not disclose or use:<ol style="list-style-type: lower-alpha;"><li>any term of a contract to which Party 2 is a party;</li><li>the customer database of Party 2 and the contacts of its customers;</li><li>the pricing, marketing strategy, contracts and suppliers of Party 2.</li></ol></td></tr>
<tr><td width="10mm">1.2</td><td width="160mm">The obligation under clause 1.1 does not apply where Party 2 has given its prior written consent, or where a legal regulation requires the information to be disclosed.</td></tr>
<tr><td width="10mm">1.3</td><td width="160mm">Information that is or becomes publicly available other than through a breach of this Agreement is not confidential.</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
<h2>2&nbsp;&nbsp;Term</h2>
<table class="clauses" cellpadding="1">
<tr><td width="10mm">2.1</td><td width="160mm">The obligation of confidentiality lasts for the whole cooperation of the Parties and for five (5) years after it ends, whatever the reason it ends.</td></tr>
<tr><td width="10mm">2.2</td><td width="160mm">This Agreement is governed by the laws of the Czech Republic.</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
<h2>3&nbsp;&nbsp;Contractual penalty</h2>
<table class="clauses" cellpadding="1">
<tr><td width="10mm">3.1</td><td width="160mm">If Party 1 breaches its obligation under Article 1, it shall pay Party 2 a contractual penalty of CZK 50,000 for each breach.</td></tr>
<tr><td width="10mm">3.2</td><td width="160mm">Payment of the contractual penalty does not affect the right to compensation for damage in full.</td></tr>
<tr><td width="10mm">3.3</td><td width="160mm">The contractual penalty is due within thirty (30) days of the delivery of a written request for payment.</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
<h2>4&nbsp;&nbsp;Personal data</h2>
<table class="clauses" cellpadding="1">
<tr><td width="10mm">4.1</td><td width="160mm">The Parties process the personal data of the other Party's contact persons only to perform this Agreement and in line with Regulation (EU) 2016/679 (GDPR).</td></tr>
<tr><td width="10mm">4.2</td><td width="160mm">Each Party is responsible for having a legal basis to pass on the personal data of its contact persons and for having informed them of it.</td></tr>
<tr><td width="10mm">4.3</td><td width="160mm">When the cooperation ends, the Parties dispose of the other Party's personal data unless a legal regulation requires them to keep it.</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
<h2>5&nbsp;&nbsp;Return of materials</h2>
<table class="clauses" cellpadding="1">
<tr><td width="10mm">5.1</td><td width="160mm">At the request of Party 2, Party 1 shall without undue delay return all materials containing confidential information, or demonstrably destroy them, including their electronic copies.</td></tr>
<tr><td width="10mm">5.2</td><td width="160mm">Clause 5.1 does not apply to copies that Party 1 must keep under legal regulations; the obligation of confidentiality still applies to them.</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
<h2>6&nbsp;&nbsp;Final provisions</h2>
<table class="clauses" cellpadding="1">
<tr><td width="10mm">6.1</td><td width="160mm">This Agreement is the entire agreement of the Parties on its subject and replaces all earlier arrangements on it.</td></tr>
<tr><td width="10mm">6.2</td><td width="160mm">This Agreement may be changed only by written amendments signed by both Parties.</td></tr>
<tr><td width="10mm">6.3</td><td width="160mm">This Agreement is made in two counterparts, one for each Party. It may also be concluded electronically, by exchanging the signed document as a PDF or with an electronic signature.</td></tr>
<tr><td width="10mm">6.4</td><td width="160mm">This Agreement takes effect on the day it is signed by both Parties.</td></tr>
<tr><td width="10mm">6.5</td><td width="160mm">The Parties have read this Agreement, agree with its content and declare that they entered into it freely.</td></tr>
</table>
</div>
<div style="page-break-inside: avoid;">
<p style="font-weight: bold; font-size: 8.5pt;">IN WITNESS WHEREOF THE PARTIES SIGN BELOW</p>
<table cellpadding="1.5" width="100%">
<tr><td width="45%">In ____________________ on ____________</td><td width="10%"></td><td width="45%">In ____________________ on ____________</td></tr>
<tr><td height="22mm"></td><td></td><td></td></tr>
<tr><td class="line"><b>{{ firm.name }}</b><br/><span class="muted">Party 1</span></td><td></td><td class="line"><b>{{ client.name }}</b><br/><span class="muted">Party 2</span></td></tr>
</table>
</div>
